        rdfs:label "Douady & Couder (1992, 1996) self-organized magnetic-drop phyllotaxis & imperfect pitchfork cascade — Reproducibility package: 92/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Self-contained, deterministic reproduction package with runtime SHA-256 verification of all 3 files in `datasets/magnetic_drop_phyllotaxis/` (`EXPECTED_SHA256`, L91-126), an 8-check `--self-test` suite including a bitwise two-run determinism assertion (`np.allclose(..., atol=0.0)`, L1165-1217), and headless rendering of both `docs/media/magnetic_drop_phyllotaxis_comparison.png` and `docs/media/magnetic_drop_phyllotaxis_growth.gif` in <9 seconds." ;
